# Contoh konfigurasi environment Pandu.
# Salin ke `.env` untuk development lokal:  cp .env.example .env
# JANGAN commit file `.env` yang berisi secrets (sudah di-gitignore).
#
# Base URL backend API (tanpa trailing slash).
# - Laravel pandu-api lokal: http://127.0.0.1:8000 (jalankan `php artisan serve` di folder pandu-api)
# - Supabase lokal:          http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1/api (lihat supabase/README.md)
# - Supabase cloud:          https://<project-ref>.supabase.co/functions/v1/api
# - Saat dev lokal (`npm run dev`), request otomatis lewat proxy Vite `/api` ke target VITE_API_URL.
VITE_API_URL=
